  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5464</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0901</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ、&lt;Beryl&gt;。
『キューテー画家』って何？
あ、『かわいい画家』って事？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Say, Beryl, what does a "cute painter"
even do? OH! Do you paint AND model
or something?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5748</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0902</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それは『キューティー画家』っ！
……ま、ボクをそ〜呼びたければ
とめはしないけどね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's "court" painter! But if you
wanna call me cute that badly,
I'm not gonna stop you! ♪ </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6216</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0903</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ボクがなりたいのは『宮廷画家』！
皇帝様に直接召し抱えられた
超〜〜〜一流の画家の事だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's always been my dream!
They're suuuper elite artists who
work directly under the emperor!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0904</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>毎日、お城のサロンで
美味しいおやつを食べながら
楽しいおしゃべりをして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Spending your days relaxing in the
castle's salons, gossiping over teatime...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0905</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>たま〜に絵を描けば
数千万ガルドの値がつくという
夢のような職業なのさぁ∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sure you gotta crank out a painting
every now and then, but when you do
they're worth millions! It's the dream job! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7312</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0906</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……若いうちから
楽な生活夢見てっと
ロクな人間に育たねぇぞ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pretty sure I heard living your life up all pampered is only bound to raise a spoiled little brat.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7572</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0907</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん、うん。
ジィちゃんもそう言ってたなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mhm! Gramps always warned me of that, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8012</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0908</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふ、ふんだっ！
そんなの芸術の才能がない人の
ひがみだねっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-Hmph! You're just jealous us artists have the talent to live that sorta life!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
